---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const siteBase = baseUrl.endsWith('/') ? baseUrl : `${baseUrl}/`;
const recordUrl = 'https://zenodo.org/records/21889140';
const doiUrl = 'https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21889140';

const articleSchema = {
	'@context': 'https://schema.org',
	'@type': 'ScholarlyArticle',
	headline: 'Causal Observability for Active Reinforcement Learning',
	author: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Kaliel Williamson' },
	datePublished: '2026-08-11',
	identifier: 'https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21889140',
	url: recordUrl,
	license: 'https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/',
};
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="description" content="A preprint by Kaliel Williamson on cost-sensitive information acquisition for active reinforcement learning." />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={`${siteBase}favicon.svg`} />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous" />
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,400;9..40,500;9..40,600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,650;1,600;1,650&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
		<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleSchema)}></script>
		<title>Causal Observability for Active Reinforcement Learning — Kaliel Williamson</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<nav><a class="wordmark" href={siteBase}>KW<span>.</span></a><a href={siteBase}>Back to home &larr;</a></nav>
			<article>
				<p class="eyebrow">Preprint &middot; August 2026</p>
				<h1>Causal Observability for Active Reinforcement Learning</h1>
				<p class="lede">When should a reinforcement-learning system acquire additional information before acting?</p>
				<div class="actions"><a class="primary" href={recordUrl}>Read on Zenodo &nearr;</a><a href={doiUrl}>Cite DOI &nearr;</a></div>
				<section>
					<h2>Contribution</h2>
					<p>Causal Observability Optimization treats coarse observation, boundary observation, probing, transfer, continuation, and abstention as cost-sensitive meta-actions. It asks which observation regime preserves the intervention-relevant distinctions needed for a declared decision.</p>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2>Evidence</h2>
					<ul><li>A Lean-checked finite result on the sequential control value of observation refinement.</li><li>Typed replay infrastructure for connecting decisions to inspectable experimental traces.</li><li>Controlled partially observable structural causal model validation, with MiniGrid as an external protocol check.</li></ul>
				</section>
				<section>
					<h2>Research infrastructure</h2>
					<p>CogTrace is the private research infrastructure behind this work: typed event streams, replayable observation views, and claim-evidence manifests for auditable agent experiments.</p>
				</section>
			</article>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	:root { --ink: #1d2822; --muted: #526159; --canvas: #f5f3ed; --line: #d2d5ca; --accent: #a9472b; } * { box-sizing: border-box; } body { margin: 0; background: var(--canvas); color: var(--ink); font: 16px/1.6 'DM Sans', sans-serif; } main { width: min(900px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: auto; } nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 28px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: .9rem; } a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 4px; } .wordmark { font: 600 1.5rem 'DM Mono', monospace; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -.1em; } .wordmark span { color: var(--accent); } article { padding: clamp(84px, 13vw, 150px) 0; } .eyebrow { color: var(--muted); font: 500 .78rem 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; } h1, h2 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.045em; } h1 { max-width: 860px; margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 6.25rem); } h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); } .lede { max-width: 650px; margin: 32px 0; color: #35433c; font-size: 1.28rem; } .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }.primary { padding: 12px 18px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--canvas); text-decoration: none; } section { max-width: 700px; padding: 46px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); } section p, li { color: var(--muted); } ul { padding-left: 20px; } @media (max-width: 640px) { main { width: min(100% - 32px, 900px); } nav { gap: 20px; } }
</style>
